# Optional additional built-in backup sources.
#
# One absolute path inside the backup container per line. Blank lines and lines
# beginning with # are ignored by ComfierUI.
#
# The backup container exposes these useful read-only roots:
#   /source/repo          ComfierUI repository/configuration
#   /source/data          ComfyUI runtime data
#   /source/workflows     configured workflow directory
#   /source/models        writable model library
#   /source/extra-models  configured legacy/shared model library
#   /source/python        persistent Python environment
#
# Examples:
# /source/models/checkpoints/rare-model.safetensors
# /source/models/loras/private-collection
# /source/extra-models/checkpoints/unavailable
# /source/data/input/irreplaceable-reference.png
#
# Broad COMFYUI_BACKUP_INCLUDE_* category switches are still applied separately.
# This file only adds extra sources; use backup-excludes.txt to remove matching
# content from selected directories.
